    "Bias and Variance"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "57be3a8e",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "- The inability for a machine learning method to capture the true relationship is called **Bias**.\n",
    "- The difference in fits between data sets is called **Variance**"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "568e9e88",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "- Fitting the training set well but not the testing set is called **Overfitting**."
   ]
  },
  {
